{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1789290988","published":"2026-09-13T09:16:39Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:30:04.914902982Z","upstream":["CVE-2024-52005"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2024-52005","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: ANSI escape sequence injection via the sideband\n     channel, allowing a malicious remote to corrupt terminal state, hide\n     information, or insert characters into the terminal input buffer\n     during clone, fetch and push (CWE-150)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2024-52005.patch: add strbuf_add_sanitized() in\n       sideband.c and route the two remote-controlled sideband writes\n       through it, replacing control characters with the conventional\n       ^<letter> notation (^[ for ESC, ^A for 0x01, ^? for DEL) while\n       letting tab and newline through.  Also carries upstream's\n       t5409-colorize-remote-messages.sh regression test.\n     - CVE-2024-52005\n   * debian/rules: skip the git-svn test suite on armel only.  Subversion's\n     directory I/O goes through APR, and Debian's armel libapr1 links the\n     non-LFS readdir(), so dirent.d_ino is 32 bit there; when the source\n     tree lives on a filesystem handing out inode numbers >= 2^32 every\n     git-svn test aborts with \"svn: E000075: Can't read directory ...:\n     Value too large for defined data type\".  This is a limitation of the\n     build environment, not a defect in git -- Debian's own armel buildd\n     runs the same tests successfully.  All other architectures continue\n     to run the git-svn suite in full.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"git","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/git?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:2.30.2-1+deb11u5+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1789290988.json"}},{"package":{"name":"git-all","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/git-all?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:2.30.2-1+deb11u5+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1789290988.json"}},{"package":{"name":"git-cvs","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/git-cvs?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:2.30.2-1+deb11u5+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1789290988.json"}},{"package":{"name":"git-daemon-run","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/git-daemon-run?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:2.30.2-1+deb11u5+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1789290988.json"}},{"package":{"name":"git-daemon-sysvinit","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/git-daemon-sysvinit?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:2.30.2-1+deb11u5+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1789290988.json"}},{"package":{"name":"git-doc","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/git-doc?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:2.30.2-1+deb11u5+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1789290988.json"}},{"package":{"name":"git-el","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/git-el?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:2.30.2-1+deb11u5+tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-os